{"a":[1,1],"h":"<div class=\"em-intro\"><p>Buna Tekvir sûresi, Küvviret sûresi, «<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"142\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 142.1 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 3.0 3.0 3.0 19.6 27.8 27.8 27.8 36.0 36.0 56.3 73.6 73.6 82.6 82.6 94.6 102.0 117.8 124.6 132.0 132.0\" y=\"25.6 25.6 20.3 15.1 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"19.6 56.3 82.6 124.6\" y=\"25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » denilir, mekkîdir.</p><p>Âyetleri - Yirmi dokuzdur.</p><p>Kelimeleri - Yüz otuz dokuz.</p><p>Harfleri - Beşyüz otuz üç.</p><p>Fasılası -<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"88\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 88.4 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 13.6 24.7 31.6 57.7 69.0\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"42.7\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> harfleridir.</p><p>İmam Ahmed, Tirmizî ve Hâkim, İbni Ömer radıyallahü anhümâdan rivayet etmişlerdir: Resulullah sallâllahü aleyhi vessellem buyurduki «</p><p><svg class=\"ea\" width=\"436\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 436.1 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 9.7 17.3 17.3 33.0 33.0 39.7 47.3 47.3 54.0 60.7 60.7 67.6 83.3 83.3 93.7 93.7 100.6 118.6 118.6 132.0 132.0 138.7 156.0 156.0 162.7 162.7 169.6 176.3 196.6 196.6 203.3 212.3 212.3 219.0 219.0 225.7 225.7 233.3 249.0 249.0 255.7 255.7 264.0 279.7 291.0 298.6 298.6 314.3 321.7 321.7 332.3 332.3 339.0 354.7 354.7 365.3 372.0 381.0 381.0 387.7 387.7 415.6 415.6 426.0\" y=\"25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"9.7 3